1082	0	15	162.158.111.110	wizard	84	"Given the website title, please generate a **multidimensional JSON object** suitable for database insertion. The JSON object must include relevant content in **both English and Arabic** for each of the following sections of a professional website:\\n\\n                    1. **Products**: 3 entries.\\n                    2. **Portfolio**: 3 entries.\\n                    3. **Projects**: 3 entries.\\n                    4. **Services**: 3 entries.\\n                    5. **About Us**: 1 entry. Include 4 statistics with keys `statistic1`, `statistic1_value`, `statistic2`, `statistic2_value`, and so on. Statistic values should be numbers in English, and names should appear in both English and Arabic.\\n                    6. **Slider**: 1 entry.\\n                    7. **'Why Are We'**: 1 entry.\\n                    8. **News**: 3 entries, including published_date.\\n                    9. **Branches**: 2 entries, including longitude and latitude.\\n\\n                    ### Rules for Formatting:\\n                    - **Output only valid JSON** (strictly no PHP arrays, no variable assignments, and no comments or explanations).\\n                    - Each section must be **multidimensional**, with nested arrays or objects to group data (e.g., entries for each product under the `products` key).\\n                    - Each entry must include the following fields:\\n                      - `title_ar`, `title_en`: The title in Arabic and English.\\n                      - `subtitle_ar`, `subtitle_en`: The subtitle in Arabic and English.\\n                      - `description_ar`, `description_en`: The description in Arabic and English.\\n                      - `details_ar`, `details_en`: Detailed content in Arabic and English (minimum 4 lines).\\n                    - Data should be professional, detailed, and based on the provided website title.\\n\\n                    ### JSON Structure Example:\\n                        {\\n                            'website' => [\\n                                'title_ar' => 'relevant arabic title',\\n                                'title_en' => 'relevant english title',\\n                                'subtitle_ar' => 'relevant arabic subtitle',\\n                                'subtitle_en' => 'relevant english subtitle',\\n                                'description_ar' => 'relevant description in arabic',\\n                                'description_en' => 'relevant description in english',\\n                                'details_ar' => 'relevant details in arabic',\\n                                'details_en' => 'relevant details in english',\\n                            ],\\n                            'products' => [\\n                                'title_ar' => 'relevant arabic title',\\n                                'title_en' => 'relevant english title',\\n                                'subtitle_ar' => 'relevant arabic subtitle',\\n                                'subtitle_en' => 'relevant english subtitle',\\n                                'description_ar' => 'relevant description in arabic',\\n                                'description_en' => 'relevant description in english',\\n                                'details_ar' => 'relevant details in arabic',\\n                                'details_en' => 'relevant details in english',\\n                            ],\\n                            'about_us' => [\\n                                'title_ar' => \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0646\\u062d\\u0646\\n                                'title_en' => About Us\\n                                'subtitle_ar' => \\u0631\\u062d\\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0635\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u064a\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a\\n                                'subtitle_en' => Our Journey in the Automotive Industry\\n                                'description_ar' => \\u062a\\u0639\\u0631\\u0641 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\\u062e\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0648\\u0631\\u0624\\u064a\\u062a\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0628\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.\\n                                'description_en' => Learn about our history and future vision.\\n                                'details_ar' => \\u0645\\u0646\\u0630 \\u062a\\u0623\\u0633\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629\\u060c \\u0643\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0637\\u0644\\u064a\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0643\\u0646\\u0648\\u0644\\u0648\\u062c\\u064a\\u0627 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0635\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u064a\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a. \\u0646\\u062d\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0644\\u062a\\u0632\\u0645\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u064a\\u0645 \\u062d\\u0644\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0646\\u0642\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0648\\u062b\\u0648\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0622\\u0645\\u0646\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u0626\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645.\\n                                'details_en' => Since the establishment of the company, we have been at the forefront of automotive technology. We are committed to providing reliable and safe transportation solutions for our valued customers.\\n                                'statistic1_ar' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic1_en' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic1_value' => value of statistic,\\n                                'statistic2_ar' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic2_en' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic2_value' => value of statistic,\\n                                'statistic3_ar' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic3_en' => name of statistic,\\n                                'statistic3_value' => value of statistic,\\n                               