4324	0	87	162.158.23.67	about	{"About_Title_ar":"\\u0645\\u0646 \\u0646\\u062d\\u0646","About_Summary_ar":"Our Story\\r\\nServicelyExchange was born out of a passion for helping freelancers, SMEs, and less big companies succeed. As a team of entrepreneurs and business professionals, we've experienced the struggles of building and growing a business firsthand.\\r\\n\\r\\nOne of the biggest challenges we faced was finding affordable ways to access the services and resources we needed to succeed. We realized that many other businesses faced the same challenge, and that's when the idea for ServicelyExchange was born.\\r\\nOur goal is to make it easier for businesses to access the services they need to succeed by leveraging the power of bartering. We believe that bartering is an innovative and sustainable solution that can help businesses thrive while also promoting collaboration and community.\\r\\nWe've spent countless hours researching and developing the ServicelyExchange platform to ensure that it's user-friendly, secure, and effective. Our team is committed to providing exceptional customer service and support to ensure that our users get the most out of our platform.\\r\\nWe're excited about the future of ServicelyExchange and the impact we can have on businesses around the world. Join us on this journey and let's build a stronger, more collaborative business community together.","About_Detail_ar":"<p>\\u0647\\u0630\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0635 \\u064a\\u0645\\u0643\\u0646 \\u0623\\u0646 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645 \\u062a\\u0631\\u0643\\u064a\\u0628\\u0647 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0623\\u064a \\u062a\\u0635\\u0645\\u064a\\u0645 \\u062f\\u0648\\u0646 \\u0645\\u0634\\u0643\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0641\\u0644\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0628\\u062f\\u0648 \\u0648\\u0643\\u0623\\u0646\\u0647 \\u0646\\u0635 \\u0645\\u0646\\u0633\\u0648\\u062e\\u060c \\u063a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0646\\u0638\\u0645\\u060c \\u063a\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0646\\u0633\\u0642\\u060c \\u0623\\u0648 \\u062d