7903	0	0	162.158.95.92	contactus	{"name":"Dominic Dunhill","phone":"","email":"dunhill.dominic@yahoo.com","message":"To the dinggy.net Owner.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis is Dominic and I stumbled upon dinggy.net a moment ago.  \\r\\n\\r\\nAppears great\\u2026 but now what?\\r\\n\\r\\nBy that I mean, when someone such as me discovers your website \\u2013 either through Search or just bouncing around \\u2013 what happens next?  Do you get numerous of leads from your site, or at least enough to make you pleased?\\r\\n\\r\\nFrankly, most business websites fall somewhat short when it comes to generating paying customers. Studies show that 70% of a site\\u2019s visitors leave and are gone forever after just a moment.\\r\\n\\r\\nHere\\u2019s an idea\\u2026\\r\\n \\r\\nHow about making it really SIMPLE for every visitor who shows up to get a personal phone call from you as soon as they hit your site\\u2026\\r\\n \\r\\nYou can \\u2013\\r\\n  \\r\\nWeb Conversion is a software widget that\\u2019s functions on your site, prepared to capture any visitor\\u2019s Name, Email address and Phone Number.  It alerts you the moment they tell you they\\u2019re interested \\u2013 so that you can speak to that lead while they\\u2019re literally looking over your site.\\r\\n\\r\\nCLICK HERE https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/3LPltcD to test a Live Demo with Web Conversion now to see precisely how it works.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou\\u2019ll be astonished - the difference between contacting someone within 5 minutes versus a half-hour or more later could increase your results 100-fold.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt gets even better\\u2026 once you\\u2019ve captured their phone number, with our new SMS Text With Lead feature, you can instantly start a text (SMS) conversation.\\r\\n  \\r\\nThat way, even if you don\\u2019t close a deal right away, you can follow-up with text messages for new offers, content links, even just \\u201chow you doing?\\u201d notes to establish a relationship.\\r\\n\\r\\nVery sweet \\u2013 AND effective.\\r\\n\\r\\nCLICK HERE https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/3LPltcD to find out what Web Visitors Into Leads can do for your business.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou could be converting up to 100X more leads today!\\r\\n\\r\\nDominic\\r\\nPS: Web Visitors Into Leads offers a FREE 14 days trial \\u2013 and it even includes International Long Distance Calling. \\r\\nYou have customers eager with you right now\\u2026 don\\u2019t keep them waiting. \\r\\nCLICK HERE https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/3LPltcD to try Lead Conversion now.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you'd like to unsubscribe click here https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/3rD0G5c\\r\\n\\r\\nMerely a swift message - the names and email address used in this message, Dominic and Dunhill, are substitutes and not actually actual contact details. We cherish transparency and wished to assure you\\u2019re informed! If you aspire to communicate with the true entity responsible for this communication, do visit our website, and we\\u2019ll connect you with the proper person.\\r\\n","captcha":"7ndcf"}	send	2023-10-15 03:50:29
