64a\\u0644 \\u0646\\u062c\\u0627\\u062d\\u0646\\u0627.<\\/p>","About_Title1_ar":"","About_Title1_Value_ar":"0","About_Title2_ar":"","About_Title2_Value_ar":"0","About_Title3_ar":"","About_Title3_Value_ar":"0","About_Title4_ar":"","About_Title4_Value_ar":"0","About_Title_en":"About us","About_Summary_en":"Is a professional firm specialized in the field of law and legal advice for entities of all kinds established in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, and aims through its work to exercise several legal roles in many legal fields that achieve the goal of clients in practicing their business in accordance with the regulations in force in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.","About_Detail_en":"<p>BARAA OSAMA MOUSSA LAW FIRM<\\/p><p>Is a professional firm specialized in the field of law and legal advice for entities of all kinds established in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, and aims through its work to exercise several legal roles in many legal fields that achieve the goal of clients in practicing their business in accordance with the regulations in force in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Our Vision<\\/p><p>We are keen to provide our services carefully and attentively to clients, and the establishment of &nbsp;professional principles is based on several elements, the most important of which is the \\"principle of integrity and honesty\\", which are the most vital qualities of a lawyer, and knowing the importance of the legal role in the work of members of society and entities of all kinds, whether local or foreign, we provide the highest level of quality of legal services that allow us to be an essential part in the success of our clients and their preferred strategic partner.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Mission<\\/p><p>Our professional records guarantee our ability to enhance trust within our clients based on result, and our sustainable relationships as a result of discussions with the client and informing them of their legal status prior to starting any business, and e