uarial service is a method of identifying, evaluating and planning the financial impact of risks taken by companies. In the insurance and finance industries, actuaries use mathematical and statistical methods to evaluate risk levels. Other fields, such as economics, probability and computer programming, are also used to create actuarial models. This is how insurance companies predict future payouts.<\\/span><\\/li><li><span style=\\"color:black;\\">Actuarial valuation and reporting of end-of-service benefits is more than simply calculating the present value of the defined benefit obligation. Instead, it requires a more detailed analysis of the liability and the key factors behind it.<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul>","LinkType":"description","Link":"","Status":"1"}	update	2023-11-17 19:34:48
